### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001
@authToken = your-jwt-token-here
@examId = 1f9521c7-c52c-4edc-9b3e-e5341188f481
@examSlug = ets-toeic-2024-test-1
@attemptId = your-attempt-id-here


### 1. Get List of TOEIC Exams (with filter by year, series, pagination)
GET {{baseUrl}}/toeic/exams?year=2024&series=ETS
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}


### 2. Get Exam Summary & Part Question Counts
GET {{baseUrl}}/toeic/exams/{{examSlug}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 3. Get Questions for Full Exam (sanitized without answers for test mode)
GET {{baseUrl}}/toeic/exams/{{examSlug}}/questions
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 4. Practice Specific Part (e.g. Part 5 only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/toeic/exams/{{examSlug}}/questions?targetPart=PART_5
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 5. Start Exam Attempt
# @name startAttempt
POST {{baseUrl}}/toeic/exams/{{examId}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetPart": null
}

### 6. Submit Exam Attempt & Get Scaled Score
POST {{baseUrl}}/toeic/attempts/{{attemptId}}/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "timeSpent": 3600,
  "answers": [
    {
      "questionId": "your-question-id",
      "selectedAnswer": "A"
    }
  ]
}

### 7. Get Attempt Review & Full Explanations
GET {{baseUrl}}/toeic/attempts/{{attemptId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 8. Get User Exam History
GET {{baseUrl}}/toeic/user/history
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 9. AI: Generate Full or Custom TOEIC Exam
POST {{baseUrl}}/toeic/ai/generate-exam
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "ETS TOEIC 2024 AI Simulation",
  "year": 2024,
  "difficulty": "INTERMEDIATE",
  "topic": "Corporate Business, Office Management, Logistics",
  "parts": ["PART_5", "PART_7"],
  "saveToDatabase": true
}

### 10. AI: Generate Questions for Specific Part (e.g. Part 5)
POST {{baseUrl}}/toeic/ai/generate-part
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "part": "PART_5",
  "count": 5,
  "difficulty": "INTERMEDIATE",
  "topic": "Business Contracts & Negotiations"
}

### 11. AI: Generate Questions and Append to Existing Exam
POST {{baseUrl}}/toeic/ai/exams/{{examId}}/generate-part
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "part": "PART_5",
  "count": 5,
  "topic": "Human Resources & Recruitment"
}
